#: scenario:scenario_28D6040B_1653_440E_9709_DD0BF42A7F92
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5188e2030ec8a7a90346826476315a8b2ba4aa4d6b8d9851cf60720af700298
#. default-sha256: cd6ad5d55f8395fa645a49fb311c3709c6d73e9cd9ea4dca156b52ca26900638
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_28D6040B_1653_440E_9709_DD0BF42A7F92"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫Hahh, ⟪k:19⟫hah... ⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫haahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫……哈、⟪k:15⟫嗬……"
"⟪k:16⟫哈……"

#: scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 392074f38b0f4e2adc2953594825646b265e6d258aad7ad0a7cb70201728397f
#. default-sha256: 15fbb7f1b64fc2bc6edcf18c76b7e0a04600ba47da13ccb4ef60efc3f6aa01e4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_76414AD9_CBC2_4E2D_9A48_5BD226AF7166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In a fevered frenzy, Mell fled from the mansion. ⟪k:1⟫Even in early summer, the night was "
"cold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫被冲动驱使着，⟪k:1⟫梅尔惊慌地跑出了房子。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫尽管现在是初夏，⟪k:4⟫但他却感觉到刺骨的寒"
"冷。"

#: scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2114cc776ab794cfeed9125fea84b95f67cff0f02814c28ea2e680ef9edf9be1
#. default-sha256: 05aae09f6cc10cb279975bbbd507bae3185acdc098bb0ef05cd9c0e1a7f08a6b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6801AEDC_0747_46BB_8CFE_962228550A8F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And to make matters worse, raindrops pelted him from head to toe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫落在梅尔身上的每一滴雨水，⟪k:1⟫仿佛一枚枚的针，⟪k:2⟫深深扎入皮肤。"

#: scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12dd60788741d9f7d72929bf6da1981636fc1ff52d9a28feef61f47f7ad1d787
#. default-sha256: f108381c06f76c6a9aac4505d0175396671f77f9d6fc7e3674aadacdf486985d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CCA9673A_482B_43E1_A63C_1E2C96681A1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that caused him little discomfort, for a far greater maelstrom of pain rampaged within "
"his breast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但这些痛感并非难以忍受。⟪k:1⟫真正的让他苦痛难耐之物，⟪k:2⟫在于他的心里。"

#: scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18fc74b7f04ea7d4b0c7e8c8311db90f5b2fd0e3511b944d4d0da67a9345518b
#. default-sha256: 7e6994ecf2840e8e0e28708b992ad9798e6ede0f273d55b6370ec30ea64d43bf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_140790A3_031E_46EE_A5A9_C09D5D593EE8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At night, the town took on a different appearance. ⟪k:1⟫Not simply for lack of illumination, "
"but the people active within it as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫夜幕笼罩下的街道，⟪k:1⟫和白昼下完全是两个世界。⟪k:2⟫昼与夜的区别，⟪k:3⟫并非熄灭的路灯，⟪k:4⟫"
"或是寂静的巷口。⟪k:5⟫而是蛰伏在黑暗下的「人」。"

#: scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f6b332abfa4c20d44cb616408d004be5df35114211ce0b6ff1d9691c6d22b9d
#. default-sha256: a6d05c9bf78baf174707c4f59d9a47bdeb2551b754edb141728ef176f9795c31
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5678B376_21F6_4AA4_B7F2_5DAE02514F57"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not a suitable place for a young aristocratic man to go wandering unattended."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫对于一名贵族的青年，⟪k:1⟫现在的街道危机四伏。"

#: scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 881cf070ca3ca70c47cf038b83f724c47e3f43312ae15591943941d4deadb127
#. default-sha256: c569e13b61343314990f069614a488a78a79f087fae3defa703484eed00e5614
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_320635AE_966E_4446_B2EE_B0BF550649BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The darkness is not only the abode of devils, but of beggars, thieves, criminals, and all "
"manner of things undesirable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫暗黑不仅会招来恶魔，⟪k:1⟫黑暗之下也同样隐藏着乞丐、盗贼、犯罪者……⟪k:2⟫各种无法见得天日之物，"
"⟪k:3⟫都隐藏着獠牙，⟪k:4⟫潜伏在黑幕中的某个角落。"

#: scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b689807c5d3c243eb67ada84b4428cd0d936c151cdfbf09c418aa90752a6054e
#. default-sha256: 1653028544afaf15c9147b04a03c83448b648d6a60c0523db65e68b618301d13
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CE475EBF_25A7_4D0A_8CA6_D1F696B6A135"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………呜！"

#: scenario:scenario_7C893E1F_346E_4C9F_B42E_D76879C2965A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28ce52b68c7b80a944d748eb05d657966011e744be13dd42cc951f9c6f730bf2
#. default-sha256: 9b93878ea0acdaa960406173a7e2009b874cbc0f5c58b0fc311d2027ab92a24e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7C893E1F_346E_4C9F_B42E_D76879C2965A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But despite that, he continued to run, knowing not where he was to head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他只身穿着睡衣，不顾一切地奔跑。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫但究竟应该前往哪个方向？⟪k:3⟫连他自己都不明白。"

#: scenario:scenario_7007E2B4_607A_4FF5_8C31_8FF521D1D873
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fae867d7cba44d5f90c0b8361990487228e3e7cf8128cc8ff8b7eb694fa88f6d
#. default-sha256: 397bca21d92fd27d235ec553522e82ddf040d8032508130ab91ae6cf717e0f15
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7007E2B4_607A_4FF5_8C31_8FF521D1D873"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He simply went where his feet took him. ⟪k:1⟫And where he arrived was the church."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他一刻不停地奔跑，⟪k:1⟫大脑一片空白地穿过熟悉又陌生的街道……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫最后，⟪k:4⟫来到了教堂的"
"入口。"

#: scenario:scenario_A737D17B_7F90_44CE_BBCC_E5F99BB3C160
