#: scenario:scenario_182311F2_5513_42F9_B689_09F7191FC8F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb7141e7e44c5e0edd26c94cef2fbb0c0e92cc24e945a511c57f4f3ce4a107cf
