msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（关于那幅画，⟪k:1⟫关于那位少女，⟪k:2⟫关于奈莉的感情）"

#: scenario:scenario_7D077E74_D86D_4AD4_982D_EBA758761BF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09927f3346c53ef8afd693092884c7bbfca9bd1bce888602079c034f8e3b2c43
