#: scenario:scenario_B1C11B02_65A8_4A5F_A732_70D75FA8C677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adddc238f7278f3011404de88b0c2b5f789f86b1c47ec97da69bdb4bdb69ed12
