msgid "⟪k:0⟫Open the door!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫开门啊……！"

#: scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e31c808c514cee6f056e9037cdc0e394681b05e7cfa38335aeab06a3f311fbb
#. default-sha256: 16245199aa74a140f5ad02723d804da6bb851a90a99a516c6d82cc9aa2e154d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9C0B4BD0_A326_4AAF_9A1E_428235FC6D1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But as you might expect, the door was locked, and the priest showed no sign of responding to "
"his calls. ⟪k:1⟫The sound of the pouring rain drowned out everything else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫理所当然的，⟪k:1⟫教堂的门始终紧闭着。⟪k:2⟫神父似乎也没有察觉到门前的动静。⟪k:3⟫回应着梅尔疑问"
"的，⟪k:4⟫只有四周淅沥的雨声。"

#: scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1081c4e1f5d1a84adad87b2ec39db732b385a62bf6e794faa68ac955bf1bf59
#. default-sha256: 5692c2a4a03a57731bb6d6e47962b2e9c83f6ddf52187c6851de38b24f08ab19
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_79338D90_4BD2_43EF_B5AB_E1A8DE245487"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nnh..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……⟪k:1⟫求……⟪k:2⟫求……"

#: scenario:scenario_A9C0F767_79A2_4DB6_92EC_132010EF2A30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54ba291caeb9a4b0acec976965d38c2c5f03d8bf3bf727c6bfef96d45019d923
#. default-sha256: 0af35f2a9b4854bec02946db7059c76b72c925121dddfefe6d5b7284f1e289b7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A9C0F767_79A2_4DB6_92EC_132010EF2A30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His head drooped feebly. ⟪k:1⟫He looked like a helpless little calf who had wandered, alone, "
"onto a dark, precarious mountain path with no end in sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫绝望中的梅尔，⟪k:1⟫无助地垂下了头……⟪k:2⟫他的身影，仿佛迷途的羔羊。"

#: scenario:scenario_8EAD7373_0AA2_4954_ACE6_8051992CE92A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 189509c436f8e6d30dc0e815fee9d39ad170ee250317a4f614b3af51788fb56d
#. default-sha256: 999d1fb5d883cfcd27e8d919f8e65910165d2d92b93f28b905d39a604509420e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8EAD7373_0AA2_4954_ACE6_8051992CE92A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为什么………"

#: scenario:scenario_6ED4B62B_E12E_4D5B_8D73_7EE2BC667616
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d20250420f219078b57774a8ea1c967bc1ef09132f8f482eb2b4db625be996
#. default-sha256: 4300552fc171530719a45590ee1a29ddef15d3112c4473ee2f08c22a9746efa3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6ED4B62B_E12E_4D5B_8D73_7EE2BC667616"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why won’t anyone tell me the truth?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All I want... ⟪k:3⟫All I want is for someone to "
"tell me it’s not true!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫为什么……⟪k:1⟫没有一个人来告诉我真相……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫哪怕……⟪k:4⟫哪怕有一个人来告诉我，⟪k:5⟫这些……"
"⟪k:6⟫都是谎言……"

#: scenario:scenario_C00DCF2D_6774_43CE_9214_83D0559ACD6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b466501bd5f87a9047cbb1bfe095287842f50ca413ff37738a4bf397f595a27
#. default-sha256: 84e6175b1832b9b89ee033b22a20b8ae70a920472d89f94e2daee5db6c0a81ac
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C00DCF2D_6774_43CE_9214_83D0559ACD6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Have I sinned?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, I didn’t know anything!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t know—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是我犯下了罪孽么……？⟪k:1⟫不对，⟪k:2⟫我什么都不知道！⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫我什么都……"

#: scenario:scenario_7676B9E7_B6A6_4D27_9D66_080D85ADA4E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e40cf0bc1cb4eb29481d9ef80765c67d86ae72b4d0923e88d0659b1675e06977
#. default-sha256: cdbd1603e8cbf0f57ff9ceb50c1b42255c9f8dc5cdf711aa3e63263beed1a5dd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7676B9E7_B6A6_4D27_9D66_080D85ADA4E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫None of it’s true...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫So I... ⟪k:5⟫I haven’t done anything "
